 E13, vol. 3','','Depicts St. Anthony’s chapel with sheep grazing and two small figures, with Edinburgh Castle and city in the distance.','2009-04-22 08:39:23','2009-05-21 13:58:14'),(718,'ABB0029',12,'View from Richmond Hill','--- \n- \"30\"\n- \"244\"\n- \"239\"\n',94,130,3,'8.6 x 14.5','1843','1843',35,'vol. 3, facing p. 573','ABD, WS E13, vol. 3','','Depicts the view of the Thames from Richmond Hill, outside London, with several small figures, including a small group apparently enjoying a picnic in the foreground.','2009-04-22 08:41:33','2009-05-21 13:58:34'),(719,'ABB0030',12,'Dumbarton Castle','--- \n- \"8\"\n- \"14\"\n- \"72\"\n',94,132,3,'9.4 x 14.1','1843','1843',35,'vol. 3, facing p. 594','ABD, WS E13, vol. 3','','Depicts Dumbarton Castle on top of Dumbarton Rock, from across the river Clyde, with sailing vessels on the water, and a boat apparently in dock in the foreground. ','2009-04-22 08:50:40','2009-06-28 16:06:56'),(720,'ABB0031',12,'River Clyde below Greenock / Roseneath and Mouth of the Gair-Loch in the Distance','--- \n- \"8\"\n- \"72\"\n- \"244\"\n',94,42,3,'8.4 x 14.6','1843','1843',35,'vol. 3, facing p. 597','ABD, WS E13, vol. 3','','Depicts the River Clyde below Greenock, with the isle of Roseneath and the mouth of Loch Gairloch in the distance, and a sailing vessel and horse and cart in the foreground.','2009-04-22 08:53:51','2009-05-21 13:59:29'),(721,'ABB0032',12,'View on Loch Long','--- \n- \"8\"\n- \"30\"\n- \"124\"\n- \"72\"\n',71,128,3,'8.7 x 13.5','1843','1843',35,'vol. 3, facing p. 616','ABD, WS E13, vol. 3','','Depicts Loch Long with boats on the water, and two tiny figures looking at the view.','2009-04-22 08:56:43','2009-05-21 13:59:44'),(722,'ABB0033',12,'Highland Pass, near the Gairloch','--- \n- \"143\"\n- \"46\"\n- \"47\"\n- \"72\"\n- \"351\"\n',94,128,3,'8.5 x 12.5','1843','1843',35,'vol. 3, facing p. 650','ABD, WS E13, vol. 3','','Depicts two Highlanders clambering over a fallen tree that lies over rocky cliffs, with a waterf