ughter Overtaken by the Tide','--- \n- \"191\"\n- \"143\"\n- \"76\"\n- \"362\"\n- \"361\"\n',170,165,6,'14.5 x 9.2','1893','1893',45,'vol. 3, facing p. 64','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Sir Arthur and Isabella Wardour on a ledge along the cliff face, with Edie Ochiltree just below them, and seabirds and a turbulent sea visible to left [Ch. 7].','2009-05-11 12:19:23','2009-05-11 12:19:23'),(965,'DRY0025',3,'The Picnic at St. Ruth\'s','--- \n- \"453\"\n- \"175\"\n- \"277\"\n- \"67\"\n- \"58\"\n- \"79\"\n- \"362\"\n- \"361\"\n',170,165,6,'14.5 x 9.2','1893','1893',45,'vol. 3, facing p. 154','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Oldbuck, the Wardours, Douterswivel, and Blattergowl seated in the country before a table cloth with food on the ground, with others (including Lovel) around them [Ch. 17]','2009-05-11 12:22:23','2009-05-11 12:22:23'),(966,'DRY0026',3,'The Duel between Lovel and Captain M\'Intyre','--- \n- \"296\"\n- \"58\"\n- \"367\"\n- \"76\"\n- \"178\"\n',170,165,6,'15 x 9.5','1893','1893',45,'vol. 3, facing p. 186','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts McIntyre wounded on the ground, with the Lovel on his feet holding his hand, and the surgeon attending, with the two seconds and Edie Ochiltree around them [Ch. 20].','2009-05-11 12:26:25','2009-06-30 08:05:58'),(967,'DRY0027',3,'Edie and Douterswivel in the Chapel ','--- \n- \"284\"\n- \"7\"\n- \"277\"\n- \"38\"\n- \"76\"\n',170,165,6,'14.3 x 9.2','1893','1893',45,'vol. 3, facing p. 236','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Edie Ochiltree in a dug-out grave, pointing to a dark figure behind Douterswivel, who stands above the grave with a raised cudgel in his hand [Ch. 25].','2009-05-11 12:31:46','2009-05-11 12:31:46'),(968,'DRY0028',3,'Dame Elspeth and the Dead Fisherman ','--- \n- \"175\"\n- \"20\"\n- \"366\"\n',170,165,6,'14.4 x 9.3','1893','1893',45,'vol. 3, facing p. 286','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts crone-like figure of old Elspeth in a chair, staring intently at the coffin of her grandson Steenie placed opposite her, with family 