o the seated King James [Ch. 5].','2009-06-17 13:04:29','2009-06-30 08:09:22'),(1387,'DRY0134',10,'Dame Ursula and Margaret Ramsay','--- \n- \"150\"\n- \"148\"\n',220,165,6,'14.5 x 9.5','1893','1893',45,'vol. 14, facing p. 92','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Margaret Ramsay seated on a chair, one hand on her chin, and Dame Ursula Suddlechop standing behind with a look of concerned interest [Ch. 8].\r\n\r\n','2009-06-17 13:05:50','2009-06-17 13:05:50'),(1388,'DRY0135',10,'Gambling at Beaujeu\'s Ordinary','--- \n- \"386\"\n- \"33\"\n- \"240\"\n- \"293\"\n',220,165,6,'14.5 x 9.3','1893','1893',45,'vol. 14, facing p. 150','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts a table with three gamblers, as Nigel Olifaunt and Lord Dalgarno look on [Ch. 12].','2009-06-17 13:07:31','2009-06-17 13:07:31'),(1389,'DRY0136',10,'Lord Glenvarloch Strikes Lord Dalgarno','--- \n- \"103\"\n- \"296\"\n- \"386\"\n- \"293\"\n- \"246\"\n',220,165,6,'14.5 x 9.5','1893','1893',45,'vol. 14, facing p. 186','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Nigel Olifaunt confronting Lord Dalgarno in St James’s Park, with his sword drawn as if to strike Dalgarno [Ch. 16].','2009-06-17 13:09:31','2009-06-28 14:44:23'),(1390,'DRY0137',10,'Lady Hermione and Margaret','--- \n- \"149\"\n- \"150\"\n',220,165,6,'14.7 x 9.5','1893','1893',45,'vol. 14, facing p. 228','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Margaret Ramsay kneeling before the seated Lady Hermione in her apartment [Ch. 20].','2009-06-17 13:11:01','2009-06-17 13:11:01'),(1391,'DRY0138',10,'Murder of Old Trapbois','--- \n- \"103\"\n- \"229\"\n- \"293\"\n- \"142\"\n- \"424\"\n',220,165,6,'14.3 x 9.5','1893','1893',45,'vol. 14, facing p. 290','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Nigel Olifaunt having rushed through the doorway, sword in one hand and candle in the other, with Martha Trapbois and the body of one of her assailants on the floor, while the remaining ruffian aims his pistol at Nigel [Ch. 24].','2009-06-17 13:13:02','2009-06-28 14:44:55'),(1392,'DRY0139',10,'King James and Nigel in Greenwich Park