 bier [Ch. 23].','2009-06-18 13:37:03','2009-06-18 13:37:03'),(1472,'DRY0219',9,'Simon Glover and Eachin in the Hut','--- \n- \"20\"\n- \"211\"\n- \"338\"\n',223,165,6,'9.5 x 14.7','1894','1894',45,'vol. 22, facing p. 342','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Ian Eachin MacIan (‘Conachar’) bent up in despair over the table in a Highland hut, as Simon Glover stands above offering consolation [Ch. 23].','2009-06-18 13:38:53','2009-06-18 13:38:53'),(1473,'DRY0220',9,'The Combat Between Torquil and Harry of the Wynd','--- \n- \"103\"\n- \"296\"\n- \"209\"\n- \"338\"\n- \"568\"\n',223,165,6,'9.5 x 14.7','1894','1894',45,'vol. 22, facing p. 422','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Torquil (in armour and kilt) and Henry Gow (armour and trousers) wielding two-handed swords in combat with each other, as Ian Eachin MacIan (‘Conachar’) looks on from the side attempting to arm himself [Ch. 34].','2009-06-18 13:41:45','2009-06-18 13:41:45'),(1474,'DRY0221',2,'Ferrand de Vaudemont, King René, and Margaret of Anjou','--- \n- \"320\"\n- \"216\"\n- \"532\"\n- \"569\"\n',170,165,6,'14.6 x 9.5','1894','1894',45,'vol. 23 (frontispiece)','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Ferrand de Vaudemont in a full suit of armour facing Margaret of Anjou and pointing to parchment on the table, at which the bearded King René is seated [Ch. 32].','2009-06-18 13:44:41','2009-12-11 10:20:01'),(1475,'DRY0222',2,'The Swiss Deputies before Charles of Burgundy','--- \n- \"570\"\n- \"467\"\n- \"146\"\n',170,165,6,'7 x 8','1894','1894',45,'vol. 23 (title-page vignette)','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts the Landamman Biederman kneeling before the enthroned Duke of Burgundy at his court [Ch. 28]. Title/caption from List of Illustrations.','2009-06-18 13:46:59','2009-06-18 13:46:59'),(1476,'DRY0223',2,'Anne Rescues Arthur Philipson','--- \n- \"143\"\n- \"223\"\n- \"72\"\n- \"217\"\n',170,165,6,'14.5 x 9.4','1894','1894',45,'vol. 23, facing p. 26','NLS, NG.1179.d','','Depicts Arthur Philipson clinging to the trunk of an old tree along a 